    "function_v0": {
      "doc": "Attested birth (new entry) or attested rotation (inactive\\nentry). New: sig must verify under the CARRIED pk. Rotation\\nof an attested entry: sig must verify under the ENROLLED pk\\nand the carried pk must equal it. Rotation of an unenrolled\\nentry: sig under the carried pk enrolls it at birth of the\\nrotation.",
